{"seq":4,"slug":"feedback-systems","title":"反馈系统与奖励机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-design/game-design-fundamentals/feedback-systems","wordCount":1898,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"反馈系统与奖励机制\">反馈系统与奖励机制</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>反馈系统（Feedback System）是游戏与玩家之间的对话通道——它将游戏内部的状态变化转化为玩家可感知的信号，引导玩家理解规则、做出决策并获得情感满足。奖励机制（Reward System）则是反馈系统中最核心的子系统，它定义了什么行为值得鼓励、以何种方式鼓励，从而塑造玩家的长期行为模式。</p>\n<p>反馈和奖励的本质是强化学习——正反馈增加行为重复概率，负反馈减少行为重复概率。游戏设计的独特之处在于，设计者可以完全控制反馈的时机、强度和形式，创造出比现实世界更高效的学习和激励环境。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[玩家行为] --&gt; B{行为评估}&#10;    B --&gt;|正向行为| C[正反馈]&#10;    B --&gt;|负向行为| D[负反馈]&#10;    B --&gt;|中性行为| E[信息反馈]&#10;    C --&gt; F[视觉效果]&#10;    C --&gt; G[音效反馈]&#10;    C --&gt; H[数值奖励]&#10;    D --&gt; I[惩罚信号]&#10;    D --&gt; J[状态限制]&#10;    E --&gt; K[状态提示]&#10;    F --&gt; L[行为强化]&#10;    G --&gt; L&#10;    H --&gt; L&#10;    I --&gt; M[行为抑制]&#10;    J --&gt; M&#10;    L --&gt; A&#10;    M --&gt; A\">graph TD\n    A[玩家行为] --&gt; B{行为评估}\n    B --&gt;|正向行为| C[正反馈]\n    B --&gt;|负向行为| D[负反馈]\n    B --&gt;|中性行为| E[信息反馈]\n    C --&gt; F[视觉效果]\n    C --&gt; G[音效反馈]\n    C --&gt; H[数值奖励]\n    D --&gt; I[惩罚信号]\n    D --&gt; J[状态限制]\n    E --&gt; K[状态提示]\n    F --&gt; L[行为强化]\n    G --&gt; L\n    H --&gt; L\n    I --&gt; M[行为抑制]\n    J --&gt; M\n    L --&gt; A\n    M --&gt; A</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>反馈类型</th>\n<th>感官通道</th>\n<th>响应延迟</th>\n<th>信息量</th>\n<th>情感影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>视觉反馈</td>\n<td>视觉</td>\n<td>即时</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>满足感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>音效反馈</td>\n<td>听觉</td>\n<td>即时</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>冲击感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>触觉反馈</td>\n<td>触觉</td>\n<td>即时</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>沉浸感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数值反馈</td>\n<td>视觉/认知</td>\n<td>短延迟</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>成就感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>叙事反馈</td>\n<td>视觉/听觉</td>\n<td>长延迟</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>情感投入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>社交反馈</td>\n<td>社交通道</td>\n<td>变化</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>归属感</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"即时反馈与手感打磨\">即时反馈与手感打磨</h2><p>即时反馈（Immediate Feedback）是游戏&quot;手感&quot;（Game Feel）的核心组成部分。当玩家按下按钮的瞬间，游戏必须在极短时间内（理想情况下 50 毫秒以内）给出感官响应，否则操作会感觉&quot;棉花&quot;般无力。</p>\n<p>手感打磨的五层模型：</p>\n<p><strong>第一层：输入响应</strong>——按键到动画第一帧的延迟。在动作游戏中这个延迟应控制在 3 帧（约 50 毫秒）以内。</p>\n<p><strong>第二层：动画传达</strong>——攻击动画的预备帧、打击帧和恢复帧的比例直接影响打击感。预备帧创造期待，打击帧传递力量，恢复帧提供节奏间隔。</p>\n<p><strong>第三层：效果叠加</strong>——命中时的粒子特效、击中顿帧（Hit Stop）、镜头震动和屏幕闪白共同强化打击感。</p>\n<p><strong>第四层：音效确认</strong>——打击音效的频率、层次和混响设计。低频轰鸣传递重量感，高频碎裂传递速度感。</p>\n<p><strong>第五层：结果呈现</strong>——伤害数字弹出、敌人受击动画、血条变化等视觉结果。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface HitFeedbackConfig {&#10;  hitStop: {&#10;    duration: number;&#10;    targetSlowdown: number;&#10;    attackerSlowdown: number;&#10;  };&#10;  cameraShake: {&#10;    intensity: number;&#10;    duration: number;&#10;    decay: &#39;linear&#39; | &#39;exponential&#39;;&#10;  };&#10;  particles: {&#10;    count: number;&#10;    spread: number;&#10;    speed: number;&#10;    lifetime: number;&#10;  };&#10;  screenFlash: {&#10;    color: string;&#10;    duration: number;&#10;    opacity: number;&#10;  };&#10;  damageNumber: {&#10;    fontSize: number;&#10;    floatSpeed: number;&#10;    fadeDelay: number;&#10;    criticalScale: number;&#10;  };&#10;}&#10;&#10;function applyHitFeedback(config: HitFeedbackConfig, hitData: HitResult): void {&#10;  freezeFrame(config.hitStop.duration, {&#10;    target: config.hitStop.targetSlowdown,&#10;    attacker: config.hitStop.attackerSlowdown,&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  shakeCamera(&#10;    config.cameraShake.intensity * hitData.damageMultiplier,&#10;    config.cameraShake.duration,&#10;    config.cameraShake.decay,&#10;  );&#10;&#10;  spawnParticles(hitData.position, {&#10;    ...config.particles,&#10;    count: config.particles.count * hitData.damageMultiplier,&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  showDamageNumber(hitData.position, hitData.damage, {&#10;    ...config.damageNumber,&#10;    fontSize: hitData.isCritical&#10;      ? config.damageNumber.fontSize * config.damageNumber.criticalScale&#10;      : config.damageNumber.fontSize,&#10;  });&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> HitFeedbackConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  hitStop</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    duration</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    targetSlowdown</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    attackerSlowdown</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  cameraShake</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    intensity</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    duration</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    decay</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'linear'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'exponential'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  particles</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    spread</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    speed</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    lifetime</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  screenFlash</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    color</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    duration</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    opacity</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  damageNumber</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    fontSize</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    floatSpeed</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    fadeDelay</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    criticalScale</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> applyHitFeedback</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">config</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> HitFeedbackConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">hitData</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> HitResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  freezeFrame</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(config.hitStop.duration, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    target: config.hitStop.targetSlowdown,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    attacker: config.hitStop.attackerSlowdown,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  shakeCamera</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    config.cameraShake.intensity </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hitData.damageMultiplier,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    config.cameraShake.duration,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    config.cameraShake.decay,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  spawnParticles</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(hitData.position, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    ...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">config.particles,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    count: config.particles.count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hitData.damageMultiplier,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  showDamageNumber</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(hitData.position, hitData.damage, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    ...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">config.damageNumber,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    fontSize: hitData.isCritical</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      ?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> config.damageNumber.fontSize </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> config.damageNumber.criticalScale</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      :</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> config.damageNumber.fontSize,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>击中顿帧（Hit Stop）是打击感的灵魂。当攻击命中时，游戏暂停数帧（通常 3-6 帧），让玩家的大脑有时间&quot;感受&quot;这次打击的重量。不同强度的攻击对应不同长度的顿帧——轻攻击 2-3 帧，重攻击 5-8 帧，终结技 10-15 帧。</p>\n<h2 id=\"奖励计划与行为塑造\">奖励计划与行为塑造</h2><p>奖励计划（Reward Schedule）借鉴了行为心理学的操作性条件反射理论。不同的奖励计划塑造不同的行为模式，选择正确的奖励计划是留存设计的关键。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 固定计划&#10;        FR[固定比率] --&gt;|每N次行为奖励| FR_E[稳定产出行为]&#10;        FI[固定间隔] --&gt;|每N秒奖励| FI_E[周期性活跃]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 变动计划&#10;        VR[变动比率] --&gt;|平均N次行为奖励| VR_E[高频持续行为]&#10;        VI[变动间隔] --&gt;|平均N秒奖励| VI_E[持续关注]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph 固定计划\n        FR[固定比率] --&gt;|每N次行为奖励| FR_E[稳定产出行为]\n        FI[固定间隔] --&gt;|每N秒奖励| FI_E[周期性活跃]\n    end\n    subgraph 变动计划\n        VR[变动比率] --&gt;|平均N次行为奖励| VR_E[高频持续行为]\n        VI[变动间隔] --&gt;|平均N秒奖励| VI_E[持续关注]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>奖励计划</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>行为模式</th>\n<th>抗消退性</th>\n<th>游戏应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>固定比率</td>\n<td>每完成 N 次行为获得奖励</td>\n<td>稳定但间歇停顿</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>任务完成奖励</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>变动比率</td>\n<td>平均 N 次行为获得奖励</td>\n<td>高频且持续</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>装备掉落、抽卡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>固定间隔</td>\n<td>每隔固定时间给予奖励</td>\n<td>周期性爆发</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>每日登录奖励</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>变动间隔</td>\n<td>平均间隔时间给予奖励</td>\n<td>持续关注</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>世界Boss刷新</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>变动比率计划是最强大的行为驱动力，也是最需要审慎使用的机制。它的高效性源于不确定性创造的期待感——&quot;下一次可能就是最好的&quot;。但如果不设置保底机制，长时间不出奖励会导致严重挫败。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface LootTable {&#10;  items: Array&lt;{&#10;    id: string;&#10;    weight: number;&#10;    minCount: number;&#10;    maxCount: number;&#10;  }&gt;;&#10;  pitySystem: {&#10;    enabled: boolean;&#10;    threshold: number;&#10;    guaranteedRarity: string;&#10;  };&#10;}&#10;&#10;function rollLoot(table: LootTable, attemptCount: number): LootResult {&#10;  if (table.pitySystem.enabled &amp;&amp; attemptCount &gt;= table.pitySystem.threshold) {&#10;    const guaranteed = table.items.find((item) =&gt; item.id === table.pitySystem.guaranteedRarity);&#10;    return {&#10;      item: guaranteed!,&#10;      count: randomRange(guaranteed!.minCount, guaranteed!.maxCount),&#10;      wasPity: true,&#10;    };&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  const totalWeight = table.items.reduce((sum, item) =&gt; sum + item.weight, 0);&#10;  let roll = Math.random() * totalWeight;&#10;&#10;  for (const item of table.items) {&#10;    roll -= item.weight;&#10;    if (roll &lt;= 0) {&#10;      return {&#10;        item,&#10;        count: randomRange(item.minCount, item.maxCount),&#10;        wasPity: false,&#10;      };&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return {&#10;    item: table.items[table.items.length - 1],&#10;    count: 1,&#10;    wasPity: false,&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LootTable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  items</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    weight</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    minCount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    maxCount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span